<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Study Resource Shelf</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f2ff;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #7045aa;
        }

        .resource {
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background: #f1eaff;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .resource h2 {
            color: #7045aa;
        }

        .type {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>📚 My Study Resource Shelf</h1>

    <div class="resource">
        <h2>💻 Programming Notes</h2>
        <p class="type">Type: Notes</p>
        <p>Important programming concepts, syntax and examples.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="resource">
        <h2>🗄️ Database Reference</h2>
        <p class="type">Type: Reference</p>
        <p>Useful topics about tables, keys, relationships and SQL.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="resource">
        <h2>📝 Practice Questions</h2>
        <p class="type">Type: Practice</p>
        <p>A collection of questions for revision and self-practice.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="resource">
        <h2>📖 Revision Notes</h2>
        <p class="type">Type: Quick Revision</p>
        <p>Short points that can be reviewed before an examination.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="resource">
        <h2>🧠 Important Definitions</h2>
        <p class="type">Type: Quick Reference</p>
        <p>A collection of important terms and their meanings.</p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
